header.hero-section.position-relative.d-flex.align-items-center.text-white.p-4.p-md-5
    .container-fluid.py-5
        .position-absolute.top-0.left-0
            img(src="/images/streamit_logo_s.png" alt="Logo" width="15" height="30")

        h1.fs-3.fw-bold.mb-2 Stranger Things

        .d-flex.align-items-center.gap-2.mb-3.text-light.small
            span 2025
            span 5 Seasons
            span.badge.bg-secondary.border.border-light 15
        
        p.lead.fs-6.text-light.mb-4
            | Welcome to Hawkins, Indiana, a small town with big secrets, strange sightings, government cover-ups... and a dark force that turns everything upside down.
        
        .d-flex.gap-2
            a.btn.btn-light.fw-semibold.d-flex.align-items-center.gap-2.px-4(href="#")
                i.bi.bi-play-fill
                | Play
            
            a.btn.btn-outline-light.fw-semibold.px-4(href="#")
                | More Info
